  "notes": [
    "\"How often\" is a time span with में and a number of times: हफ़्ते में एक बार (once a week), महीने में दो बार (twice a month), दिन में तीन बार (three times a day).",
    "हर रोज़, रोज़ and रोज़ाना all mean every day.",
    "Hindi has no verb \"to have\" for time either: मेरे पास टाइम नहीं है (\"near me there is no time\"). टाइम is everyday speech; समय is the Hindi word."
  ]
